{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1263830-guide-to-the-night-errata","id":1263830,"title":"Guide to the Night Errata","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-31T11:35:40-07:00","id":1263830,"title":"Guide to the Night Errata","content":"Please list your errata for VTR's <b>Guide to the Night</b> here.<br /> <br /> Please address only typos, layout glitches, misplaced elements, and similar errors. If it's merely a matter where you'd have phrased something differently, that's not errata, and should go in a different thread.<br /> <br /> Please confine comments to posting errata. Discussion should also go elsewhere.<br /> <br /> Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T12:32:02-07:00","id":1263852,"title":"","content":"From Vampire the Requiem second edition, 'A new Devotion usually costs one Experience per dot in the Devotion, halved and rounded down.'<br /> <br /> So Blood Scenting on p133 would be 1 Experience instead of 2, Bend Space on p134 3 instead of 5, Best Served Cold on p135 1 instead of 2, Blood Scenting on p136 1 instead of 4, and Whip Sharp Tongue on p137 1 instead of 2. Though that's depending on the 'usually.'<br /> <br /> On p76, it says 'the colony banes do not impose a -1 penalty' and 'Intimidation suffers a -1 penalty' but in both cases the - is replaced by a rectangle. The problem continues on the top of p77, where it says 'the Damned receives a -1 penalty on all rolls, up to -3.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-31-2018, 07:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T12:50:34-07:00","id":1263859,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 7: </b>&quot;Dracula&quot; should be italics in the page quote attribution<br /> <b>p. 29:</b> &quot;<i>Rain Falls</i> is an alternate-history noir setting for <u>Vampire the Requiem</u>.&quot; -- Should be Vampire: The Requiem, and in bold<br /> <b>p. 32, sidebar: </b>&quot;Vampire: The Requiem&quot; is in the wrong font<br /> <b>p. 125, Nauseated sidebar:</b> &quot;Possible Sources&quot; and &quot;Resolution&quot; are in the wrong font<br /> <b>p. 135, Agonized sidebar:</b> &quot;Possible Sources&quot; and &quot;Resolution&quot; are in the wrong font<br /> <br /> The <b>Ascendancy </b>setting is referred to as<b> Bleeding Edge </b>in a few places (and in corresponding entries on the table of contents):<br /> <br /> <b>p. 92, header: </b>&quot;Bleeding Edge: Slice of Life&quot; should be &quot;Ascendancy&quot;<br /> <b>p. 101: </b>&quot;In the arcologies of <b>The Bleeding Edge</b>...&quot;<br /> <b>p. 124, header: </b>&quot;Bleeding Edge&quot; should be &quot;Ascendancy&quot;<br /> <b>p. 134, header: </b>&quot;Bleeding Edge&quot; should be &quot;Ascendancy&quot;<br /> <b>p. 137: </b>&quot;Though vampires in <b>Bleeding Edge</b> cannot benefit...&quot;","sign